- **UI Design:** The UI can be improved by providing additional feedback mechanisms, such as visual animations for correct or incorrect answers, clearer navigation for starting a new game, or accessing player progress. Adding a summary of hints used or a visual representation of player progress (e.g., a progress bar) could also enhance the UI.

