### Passed Test Cases
1. |Case|:**deciphering_the_hidden_rule**
```python
CLASS Puzzle
    FUNCTION __init__(question: str, solution: str, hints: list)
        SET self.question = question
        SET self.solution = solution
        SET self.hints = hints

    FUNCTION is_correct(answer: str) -> bool
        RETURN self.solution.lower() == answer.lower()

    FUNCTION get_hint() -> str
        IF self.hints NOT EMPTY
            RETURN self.hints.pop(0)
        ENDIF
        RETURN "No more hints available."

CLASS Game
    FUNCTION __init__()
        SET self.puzzles = []
        SET self.current_level = 0
        SET self.hints_used = 0

    FUNCTION check_answer(answer: str) -> bool
        IF self.current_level < LENGTH(self.puzzles)
            RETURN self.puzzles[self.current_level].is_correct(answer)
        RETURN False
```

